icon:0011213 a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "natural community global rank"@en ;
    IAO:0000115 "How rare and threatened the alliance is across its whole range, G1 (very rare and threatened) to G5 (secure), from NatureServe's method as CDFW applies it."@en ;
